# bunny.net - The Global Edge Platform that truly Hops

> A global edge platform offering CDN, video streaming, edge storage, DNS, image optimization and edge compute — all designed for high performance, security, and simple pay-as-you-go pricing.

bunny.net combines a CDN, replicated edge storage, a video streaming platform, scriptable DNS, image optimizer and other edge products into a single platform with global PoPs, real-time monitoring, and 24/7 support — suitable for websites, video, gaming and software distribution. Key developer and product pages include product overviews, feature deep dives, pricing calculators, and customer case studies.

## Products

- [Bunny CDN](https://bunny.net/cdn/): Overview of Bunny CDN, its performance, architecture, features (Perma-Cache, SmartEdge™, SafeHop™, DDoS protection), and related region & comparison pages.
- [Bunny Storage](https://bunny.net/storage/): Description of edge-replicated object storage, tiers (Edge SSD / HDD), global replication, SLA, and upload/delivery options.
- [Bunny Stream](https://bunny.net/stream/): Video delivery platform with transcoding, player, DRM/Media Cage, resumable uploads/API, and pricing/feature summary.
- [Bunny DNS](https://bunny.net/dns/): Scriptable DNS platform with custom nameservers, advanced analytics, built-in monitoring, load balancing and DDoS protection.
- [Bunny Optimizer](https://bunny.net/optimizer/): Image and asset optimization service (Transform API), automatic WebP conversion, JS/CSS minification and a fixed-price optimizer plan.
- [Bunny Fonts](https://bunny.net/fonts/): Privacy-focused web fonts service (Google Fonts drop-in replacement) emphasizing GDPR compliance, zero logging and free usage.

